.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBenrichment\fB \fR\- the GCModeller enrichment analysis result set.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBdatabase\fB \fR\- the database label that will be written into the \fBDatabase\fR column of the KOBAS table. Default \fBn/a\fR.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
an array of the [EnrichmentTerm](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.Microarray.KOBAS.EnrichmentTerm) objects in the KOBAS table format.
.PP
